# React Native Offline SQLite Profile Storage Module

## Security Analysis

Per **AGENT_RULES §1**, email and phone number are PII and **must not** be stored in plain SQLite. The device is assumed hostile (rooted/jailbroken). I will implement the secure alternative: SQLite stores only non-sensitive profile fields, while email and phone are encrypted at rest using a key held in the platform secure store (Keychain/Keystore), with the encryption layer provided by a vetted library.

